#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:61
msgid ""
"Welcome to the official U-Connect user guide. This platform is specially "
"crafted to empower students and the university community to trade safely, "
"easily, and quickly without middlemen."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:63
msgid ""
"Whether you are looking for textbooks, electronics, hostel services, or "
"launching your campus business, U-Connect gives you all the tools at your "
"fingertips."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:68
msgid "1. User Roles"
msgstr "1. أدوار المستخدمين"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:75
msgid "Personal Seller"
msgstr "اتصل بنا"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:76
msgid ""
"Students selling their used items (phones, books, room appliances) "
"occasionally without needing a registered business."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:84
msgid "Company Owner"
msgstr "الشركة"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:85
msgid ""
"Entrepreneurs and official shops with a business brand, logo, and wide "
"product catalog (e.g., Food, Fashion, Tech gear)."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:93
msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "المشرف (Administrator)"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:94
msgid ""
"Platform administrators who verify accounts, prevent fraudulent activity, "
"and oversee system health via the Executive Command Center."
msgstr ""

