msgstr "فتح لوحة التحكم"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:155
msgid "3. Getting Started"
msgstr "3. كيفية البدء"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:160
msgid "Register an Account"
msgstr "تسجيل حساب جديد"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:162
msgid "Click the Register button in the top or bottom menu."
msgstr "انقر على زر التسجيل في القائمة العلوية أو السفلية."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:163
msgid ""
"Fill in your username, university or personal email, phone number, and a "
"secure password."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:164
msgid "Enter the 6-digit OTP code sent to your email to verify your identity."
msgstr "أدخل رمز OTP المكون من 6 أرقام المرسل إلى بريدك للتحقق من هويتك."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:165
msgid "You can immediately start browsing, buying, and listing items!"
msgstr "يمكنك فوراً البدء في التصفح والشراء وعرض المنتجات!"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:171
msgid "Install on Mobile (PWA)"
msgstr "التثبيت على الهاتف (PWA)"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:172
msgid ""
"U-Connect is a Progressive Web App, meaning you can install it directly on "
"your phone:"
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:174
msgid ""
"Open Chrome, tap the 3 dots menu and select 'Install app' or 'Add to Home "
"screen'."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:175
msgid "Open Safari, tap Share and select 'Add to Home Screen'."
msgstr "افتح Safari، وانقر على زر المشاركة واختر 'إضافة إلى الشاشة الرئيسية'."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:184
msgid "4. Buying Guide"
msgstr "4. دليل الشراء"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:188
msgid "Searching & Filtering"
msgstr "البحث والتصفية"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:190
msgid ""
"Use the top search bar to type the name of the product you are looking for."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:191
msgid ""
"Choose a category (such as Phones, Laptops, Books) to get more accurate "
"results."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:192
msgid "Check discounted prices and badges like 'Discount' or 'New'."
msgstr "تحقق من الأسعار المخفضة والشارات مثل 'خصم' أو 'جديد'."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:198
msgid "Safe Buying on Campus"
msgstr "الشراء الآمن في الحرم الجامعي"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:200
msgid ""
"Meet the seller in open campus areas (such as the library, cafeteria, or "
"main gate)."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:201
msgid "Inspect the product and verify it works properly before making payment."
msgstr "افحص المنتج وتأكد من أنه يعمل بشكل سليم قبل إتمام الدفع."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:202
msgid ""
"Use the in-app Chat to communicate safely without giving out your personal "
"phone number."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:211
msgid "5. Selling Guide"
msgstr "سعر البيع"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:214
msgid "Tip:"
msgstr "نصيحة:"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:214
msgid ""
"Take clear, well-lit photos and write an honest description of your "
"product's condition to sell faster!"
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:218
msgid "Steps to Upload a Product"
msgstr "خطوات رفع المنتج"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:220
msgid "Click the Sell button in the menu."
msgstr "انقر على زر البيع في القائمة."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:221
msgid "Select the correct Category for your product (e.g. Phones & Tablets)."
msgstr "اختر الفئة الصحيحة لمنتجك (مثل الهواتف والأجهزة اللوحية)."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:222
msgid "Upload up to 3 clean photos showing front and back views."
msgstr "ارفع حتى 3 صور واضحة توضح المظهر الأمامي والخلفي."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:223
msgid ""
"Fill in technical specifications with accurate metrics (such as mAh for "
"battery, GB for RAM and storage, Megapixels for camera)."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:224
msgid "Preview your product card on the right, then click Publish Listing."
msgstr "عاين بطاقة منتجك على اليمين ثم انقر فوق نشر الإعلان."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:231
msgid "6. Messaging System (Chat)"
msgstr "6. نظام المراسلة (الدردشة)"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:236
msgid "Real-Time Chat"
msgstr "دردشة فورية ومباشرة"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:237
msgid "Messages arrive instantly without requiring page refreshes."
msgstr "تصل الرسائل فوراً دون الحاجة إلى إعادة تحميل الصفحة."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:243
msgid "Send Photos"
msgstr "إرسال الصور"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:244
msgid "Send extra photos of products directly in chat before making a deal."
msgstr "أرسل صوراً إضافية للمنتج مباشرة في الدردشة قبل الاتفاق."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:250
msgid "Message Notifications"
msgstr "إشعارات الرسائل"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:251
msgid "Get instant sound and visual alerts when new messages arrive."
msgstr "احصل على تنبيهات صوتية ومرئية فور وصول رسائل جديدة."

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:259
msgid "7. Admin Panel & Moderation"
msgstr "7. لوحة الإدارة والتحكم"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:261
msgid ""
"U-Connect administrators have dedicated tools to oversee platform operations:"
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:265
msgid "Managed Mode (Executive Command Center):"
msgstr "التبديل إلى مركز القيادة التنفيذي"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:265
msgid ""
"Modern dashboard with analytics graphs, user management, email broadcasts, "
"and CRM support."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:269
msgid "Normal Mode (Classic Django Admin):"
msgstr "التبديل إلى لوحة إدارة دجانغو التقليدية"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:269
msgid ""
"Direct administrative interface for raw database records and rapid "
"adjustments."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:277
msgid "8. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "8. الأسئلة المتكررة (FAQ)"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:282
msgid "I cannot upload photos of my product, what should I do?"
msgstr "أواجه مشكلة في رفع صور منتجي، ماذا أفعل؟"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:287
msgid ""
"Ensure your photos are in JPG or PNG format and smaller than 5MB each. You "
"can also click the camera icon in the U-Connect Support Drawer to send a "
"screenshot of the error directly to us!"
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:294
msgid "The seller is not replying to my chat messages?"
msgstr "البائع لا يرد على رسائلي في الدردشة؟"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:299
msgid ""
"Check the seller's profile to see their last active status. If they have "
"been offline for a while, you can check similar listings from another active "
"seller on campus."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:306
msgid "What if I notice a suspicious listing or fraudulent seller?"
msgstr "ماذا أفعل إذا لاحظت إعلاناً مشبوهاً أو بائعاً محتالاً؟"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:311
msgid ""
"Please open our Support & AI drawer in the bottom right corner and tap 'Take "
"Screenshot'. The capture is sent straight to our moderation team to remove "
"the listing and take appropriate action."
msgstr ""

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:320
msgid "Still need assistance or have questions?"
msgstr "هل ما زلت بحاجة إلى مساعدة أو لديك استفسارات؟"

#: business/templates/business/documentation.html:321
msgid ""
"We're here 24/7 to help you. Chat with our support team in real-time or send "
"us a message."
msgstr ""

